cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work or the availability matrix, please cite it as below. Prefer citing the version/commit — the conclusions evolve."
title: "Offlisten 录匣：100% 离线的会议 / 课堂转写（扩展 + 本机 ASR 引擎）"
abstract: >-
  A 12.5 KB MV3 browser extension plus a local ASR engine. No account, no cloud,
  no telemetry. The repository also maintains a distributability survey of
  4 on-device ASR runtimes (ONNX Runtime / ncnn / GGUF / TensorRT) across
  3 platforms (x86-64 CPU / x86-64 + NVIDIA GPU / Windows arm64), including
  documented non-existent combinations and a ledger of negative results.
